                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b33a9715-0caa-4d2c-92c3-5c93faf8e772",
                        "source_entry_id": "75cc03f9-0e87-36dc-9a54-c2c5dce901c2",
                        "source_sense_id": "3ed0e8cf-72bd-31d0-be5f-5628f035e296",
                        "source_sense_description": "in het begin",
                        "target_lang_word": "initially",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "initially",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                        "entry_id": "d39182c3-17f1-3c6f-83cd-f03009e215e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At the beginning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42df5fd7-c6d0-49c8-a220-d3965c419227",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "Initially, I found city life incredibly difficult, but now I'm used to it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7127e53f-58fc-4cb9-84f0-d7b84143fe23",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "In his submission to the UN, [Christof] Heyns points to the experience of drones. Unmanned aerial vehicles were intended initially only for surveillance, and their use for offensive purposes was prohibited, yet once strategists realised their perceived advantages as a means of carrying out targeted killings, all objections were swept out of the way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c53cf10c-7266-41d6-8cfb-b542aa1f0f78",
                                                "sense_id": "b85b1c20-064d-31cd-bef5-81ddbb17a671",
                                                "text": "Unsurprisingly, the Group was highly critical of the BTC's organisation and finances, and this prompted Marples to bring forward the Transport Act 1962, which created BR as a standalone entity with its own Board, headed by a full-time chairman. Beeching accepted this latter position, and initially became the BTC chairman in June 1961."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1a67967-812f-45c3-bd39-80f79a8df550",
                        "source_entry_id": "75cc03f9-0e87-36dc-9a54-c2c5dce901c2",
                        "source_sense_id": "3ed0e8cf-72bd-31d0-be5f-5628f035e296",
                        "source_sense_description": "in het begin",
                        "target_lang_word": "initialement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "initialement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                                        "entry_id": "6e0b3577-1afc-3a0b-87b2-4bb225a35e5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En initiale, au commencement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ba3ddb8-27e4-4d4f-ac81-910e692d1e50",
                                                "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                                                "text": "Puis, le fandom de Tolkien s’est développé dans les années 60, à la faveur d’une réédition en poche du Seigneur des anneaux et « grâce au mouvement hippie », qui voit dans le roman initialement paru en trois volumes en 1954 et 1955 « un discours écologique et humaniste », résume Vivien Lejeune."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "954ff8ed-8a4d-4c6d-abcf-09361b18e1b4",
                                                "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                                                "text": "Il y a initialement une demande excédentaire de monnaie parce que l'accroissement de la production accroît le besoin de monnaie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb4ef1d3-b855-49d9-9ec0-2e3362493442",
                                                "sense_id": "4bf7b25b-d9b7-3c89-9b97-f5bf7a9a3c94",
                                                "text": "Initialement, Joseph Terhec ne devait disputer que la compétition par équipes des championnats du monde de judo de Tachkent (Ouzbékistan), qui commencent jeudi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "569d1689-c241-4ee8-b89e-bc8ba1424658",
